# nexora-action-code: get_cpu
# Comware V5 exposes the summary as one block per slot.  Keep only the
# actionable summary fields; the optional history/detail block is deliberately
# ignored so it cannot create empty or duplicate records.
Value Filldown SLOT (\d+)
Value CPU_5_SEC (\d+(?:\.\d+)?|--)
Value CPU_1_MIN (\d+(?:\.\d+)?|--)
Value Required CPU_5_MIN (\d+(?:\.\d+)?|--)

Start
  ^(?:Chassis\s+\d+\s+)?Slot\s+${SLOT}\s+(?:CPU\s+\d+\s+)?CPU\s+usage:\s*$$
  ^CPU\s+usage:\s*$$
  ^Unit\s+CPU\s+usage:\s*$$
  ^\s*${CPU_5_SEC}%?\s+in\s+last\s+5\s+seconds\s*$$
  ^\s*${CPU_1_MIN}%?\s+in\s+last\s+1\s+minute\s*$$
  ^\s*${CPU_5_MIN}%?\s+in\s+last\s+5\s+minutes\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*CPU\s+Last\s+5\s+sec\s+Last\s+1\s+min\s+Last\s+5\s+min\s*$$
  ^\s*Slot\s+CPU\s+Last\s+5\s+sec\s+Last\s+1\s+min\s+Last\s+5\s+min\s*$$
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+(?:\d+\s+)?${CPU_5_SEC}%\s+${CPU_1_MIN}%\s+${CPU_5_MIN}%\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$

